1
00:00:00,508 --> 00:00:02,178
(Kevin:)Anyway, man,
I dug the ape movie, Penny.

2
00:00:02,178 --> 00:00:04,048
(Kevin:)And I thought you were, like,
really great in it.

3
00:00:04,046 --> 00:00:05,176
(Howard:)Aw.

4
00:00:05,181 --> 00:00:06,451
(Wil:)You know, I'm in the movie, too.

5
00:00:06,449 --> 00:00:08,019
Yeah, whatever. Penny!

6
00:00:08,017 --> 00:00:11,557
(Kevin:)Penny, how come you're not
in more stuff, man?

7
00:00:11,554 --> 00:00:12,684
(Kevin:)I'd cast you in a minute.

8
00:00:12,688 --> 00:00:14,758
(Penny:)Seriously?
Oh, yeah, man.

9
00:00:14,757 --> 00:00:16,527
(Kevin:)I'm actually in pre-production
on a movie right now.

10
00:00:16,525 --> 00:00:17,625
(Kevin:)Way different

11
00:00:17,626 --> 00:00:18,856
(Kevin:)than anything I've ever
done before.

12
00:00:18,861 --> 00:00:21,261
It's called Clerks 3.

13
00:00:21,263 --> 00:00:22,693
(Kevin:)You should come over

14
00:00:22,698 --> 00:00:24,698
(Kevin:)and read for a part.

15
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,700
(Penny:)Oh, my, I would love that.

16
00:00:26,702 --> 00:00:28,202
(Leonard:)You have a new job.

17
00:00:28,204 --> 00:00:29,704
(Penny:)Well, maybe I can do both.

18
00:00:29,705 --> 00:00:32,275
(Leonard:)I don't think you can do both.

19
00:00:32,274 --> 00:00:34,744
(Penny:)I don't think I asked you.

20
00:00:34,743 --> 00:00:36,343
(Kevin:)Yeah, you tell him, Penny.

21
00:00:37,912 --> 00:00:40,952
(Leonard:)Stay out of it, Kevin Smith.

22
00:00:42,083 --> 00:00:44,553
(Sheldon:)Do you think there comes
a point in life

23
00:00:44,553 --> 00:00:47,723
(Sheldon:)when it stops feeling bad
to be left out of things?

24
00:00:47,723 --> 00:00:48,893
(Amy:)Probably not.

25
00:00:48,891 --> 00:00:51,161
(Amy:)It's an evolutionary advantage

26
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:53,290
(Amy:)to be included
in group activities.

27
00:00:53,295 --> 00:00:54,725
(Sheldon:)You know what?

28
00:00:54,730 --> 00:00:56,930
(Sheldon:)I used to be a fan of evolution,

29
00:00:56,932 --> 00:00:58,602
(Sheldon:)but I've since evolved,

30
00:00:58,601 --> 00:01:02,021
(Sheldon:)and now I think it's dumb.

